      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Raspka Irongrinn's secret experiment in Drydock Seven: a giant mimic fed her blood and thread, waking wrongly from a shipbirth ritual interrupted a year ago. It is not quite a ship and not quite a mimic. It does not want to die; it wants to be <em>born</em>. It lures with lights, imitates voices it has heard, and its every blow rings through the other cradles like a struck bell. Speaking to it mid-fight (Persuasion or Performance DC 15, advantage with a work-song) can stand it down. Advantage on Stealth checks in its cradle or among hulls.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
      "source": {
        "custom": "Coven Cove GM Guide",
        "revision": 1,
        "rules": "2014"
      }
